    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vasily died a while ago. He woke up here in Abelina and is struggling to survive along with a few other after-lifers. Take control of Vasily and find your way across a massive world to find a better place. There is no combat. You'll need to collect up phosphorescent seeds to break open new paths and overcome environmental platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/af093e6f8cdc38b8ef3880cbf8acb475.poster.avif?t=1747154073\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/af093e6f8cdc38b8ef3880cbf8acb475.webm?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/af093e6f8cdc38b8ef3880cbf8acb475.mp4?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOREAGE AND SMASH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need gourdies to blast open walls. To make gourdies you need seeds. Smash open the phosphorescent gourds with timing based hammer hits. The timing pattens become increasingly complex as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/5e08a6323fdb06e2d40692b856f9db6c.poster.avif?t=1747154073\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/5e08a6323fdb06e2d40692b856f9db6c.webm?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/5e08a6323fdb06e2d40692b856f9db6c.mp4?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While searching for gourds, keep an eye out for walls covered in white lichen. These walls react to the unstable gourd seeds. Sometimes they open a shortcut and sometimes they reveal new mysteries of Abelina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/2a09be192c4e395f276a2875f8ac550f.poster.avif?t=1747154073\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/2a09be192c4e395f276a2875f8ac550f.webm?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/2a09be192c4e395f276a2875f8ac550f.mp4?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUIDE YOUR COMPANIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to understand this place with the other people at camp. Their assumptions of the universe are shaken and they are struggling to survive. As you journey through Abelina they will catch up to you at the end of each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/7b5f595fedc2438758c48bd4ea56118a.avif?t=1747154073\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large world with branching paths spanning 5 biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming based exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed hit resource collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mature story about life and death told through dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs 30-50 FPS on Steam Deck (optimization options coming)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vasily died a while ago. He woke up here in Abelina and is struggling to survive along with a few other after-lifers. Take control of Vasily and find your way across a massive world to find a better place. There is no combat. You'll need to collect up phosphorescent seeds to break open new paths and overcome environmental platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/af093e6f8cdc38b8ef3880cbf8acb475.poster.avif?t=1747154073\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/af093e6f8cdc38b8ef3880cbf8acb475.webm?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/af093e6f8cdc38b8ef3880cbf8acb475.mp4?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOREAGE AND SMASH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need gourdies to blast open walls. To make gourdies you need seeds. Smash open the phosphorescent gourds with timing based hammer hits. The timing pattens become increasingly complex as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/5e08a6323fdb06e2d40692b856f9db6c.poster.avif?t=1747154073\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/5e08a6323fdb06e2d40692b856f9db6c.webm?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/5e08a6323fdb06e2d40692b856f9db6c.mp4?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While searching for gourds, keep an eye out for walls covered in white lichen. These walls react to the unstable gourd seeds. Sometimes they open a shortcut and sometimes they reveal new mysteries of Abelina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/2a09be192c4e395f276a2875f8ac550f.poster.avif?t=1747154073\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/2a09be192c4e395f276a2875f8ac550f.webm?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/2a09be192c4e395f276a2875f8ac550f.mp4?t=1747154073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUIDE YOUR COMPANIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to understand this place with the other people at camp. Their assumptions of the universe are shaken and they are struggling to survive. As you journey through Abelina they will catch up to you at the end of each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/extras/7b5f595fedc2438758c48bd4ea56118a.avif?t=1747154073\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large world with branching paths spanning 5 biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming based exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed hit resource collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mature story about life and death told through dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs 30-50 FPS on Steam Deck (optimization options coming)</p></li></ul>",
